  "raw_block": "<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\">Rec Swim Hours</h3>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Rec swim hours are subject to change; check the website regularly before coming in*.</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Lanes are available on a first-come, first-served basis during the following times for recreational lap swimming only.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">*<strong><em>Updated 10/18/26</em></strong></p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\">Comp Pool</h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Mon, 10/26: 12pm-2pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Tue, 10/27: 12pm-2pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Wed, 10/28: 12pm-2pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Thu, 10/29: 12pm-2pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Fri, 10/30: 12pm-2pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Sat, 10/31: CLOSED<br/><em>*<em>USC Swim hosting</em> <em>an event</em></em></p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Sun, 11/1: 11am-2pm</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\">Dive Pool</h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Mon, 10/26: 6am-8am, 11am-12pm, &amp; 4pm-6pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Tue, 10/27: 6am-8am, 11am-12pm, &amp; 4pm-6pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Wed, 10/28: 6am-8am, 11am-12pm, &amp; 4pm-6pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Thu, 10/29: 6am-8am, 11am-12pm, &amp; 4pm-6pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Fri, 10/30: 6am-8am, 11am-12pm, &amp; 4pm-6pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Sat, 11/1: *<strong>10am-1pm</strong><br/><em>*Modified: USC Home football game &amp; USC Swim hosting</em> <em>an event</em></p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Sun, 10/31: CLOSED</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>"
